="number" id="setting_essayMaxImageMb" min="1" max="100"><p class="setting-help">1～100MB</p></div></div></section><section class="setting-group"><h4 class="setting-group__title"><svg class="icon "><use href="/prototype-assets/icons/icons.svg#i-sliders"></use></svg>1. 画像分類・OCR</h4><div class="setting-field-grid"><div class="setting-field"><label class="setting-field__label"><span>AIモデル</span><small class="setting-field__key">essayOcrAiProvider</small></label><select class="select" id="setting_essayOcrAiProvider"></select><p class="setting-help">AIモデルページで設定したモデルを選択します。</p></div><div class="setting-field full"><label class="setting-field__label"><span>System Prompt</span><small class="setting-field__key">essayOcrPrompt</small></label><textarea class="textarea" id="setting_essayOcrPrompt" rows="5" placeholder="System Prompt"></textarea><p class="setting-help">設問と手書き作文の分離、原文保持、判読不能文字の扱いを定義します。</p></div><div class="setting-field full"><label class="setting-field__label"><span>User Prompt</span><small class="setting-field__key">essayOcrUserPrompt</small></label><textarea class="textarea" id="setting_essayOcrUserPrompt" rows="5" placeholder="User Prompt"></textarea><p class="setting-help">&#123;&#123;level&#125;&#125;、&#123;&#123;image_count&#125;&#125;、&#123;&#123;image_categories&#125;&#125;を置換し、画像を添付します。</p></div><div class="setting-field"><label class="setting-field__label"><span>AI送信画像の最大辺（px）</span><small class="setting-field__key">essayOcrMaxImagePixels</small></label><input class="input" type="number" id="setting_essayOcrMaxImagePixels" min="512" max="8192"><p class="setting-help">512～8192、超える場合は縮小。</p></div></div></section><section class="setting-group"><h4 class="setting-group__title"><svg class="icon "><use href="/prototype-assets/icons/icons.svg#i-sliders"></use></svg>2. 英検基準AI添削</h4><div class="setting-field-grid"><div class="setting-field"><label class="setting-field__label"><span>タイトル生成AIモデル</span><small class="setting-field__key">essayTitleAiProvider</small>