ss="setting-flow-step"><svg class="icon "><use href="/prototype-assets/icons/icons.svg#i-check-circle"></use></svg>画像OCR・構造化</span><span class="setting-flow-arrow">→</span><span class="setting-flow-step"><svg class="icon "><use href="/prototype-assets/icons/icons.svg#i-check-circle"></use></svg>問題別AI解説</span></div><section class="setting-group"><h4 class="setting-group__title"><svg class="icon "><use href="/prototype-assets/icons/icons.svg#i-sliders"></use></svg>アップロード制限</h4><div class="setting-field-grid"><div class="setting-field"><label class="setting-field__label"><span>最大画像枚数</span><small class="setting-field__key">clozeMaxImages</small></label><input class="input" type="number" id="setting_clozeMaxImages" min="1" max="20"><p class="setting-help">1回あたり1～20枚</p></div><div class="setting-field"><label class="setting-field__label"><span>画像1枚の最大サイズ（MB）</span><small class="setting-field__key">clozeMaxImageMb</small></label><input class="input" type="number" id="setting_clozeMaxImageMb" min="1" max="100"><p class="setting-help">1～100MB</p></div></div></section><section class="setting-group"><h4 class="setting-group__title"><svg class="icon "><use href="/prototype-assets/icons/icons.svg#i-sliders"></use></svg>1. 画像OCR・問題構造化</h4><div class="setting-field-grid"><div class="setting-field"><label class="setting-field__label"><span>AIモデル</span><small class="setting-field__key">clozeOcrAiProvider</small></label><select class="select" id="setting_clozeOcrAiProvider"></select><p class="setting-help">AIモデルページで設定したモデルを選択します。</p></div><div class="setting-field"><label class="setting-field__label"><span>AI送信画像の最大辺（px）</span><small class="setting-field__key">clozeOcrMaxImagePixels</small></label><input class="input" type="number" id="setting_clozeOcrMaxImagePixels" min="512" max="8192"><p class="setting-help">512～8192。</p></div><div class="setting-field"><label class="setting-field__label"><span>タイムアウト（秒）</span><small class="setting-field__key">clozeOcrTimeoutSeconds</small></label><input class="input" type="number" id="setting_clozeOcrTimeoutSeconds" min="30" max="1800"><p class="setting-help">30～1800秒。</p></div><div class="setting-field full"><label class="setting-field__label"><span>System Prompt</span><small class="setting-field__key">clozeOcrSystemPrompt</small></label><textarea class="textarea" id="setting_clozeOcrSystemPrompt" rows="5" placeholder="System Prompt"></textarea><p class="setting-help">問題文、選択肢、作答時の答案、正解を画像から分離してJSON化します。</p></div><div class="setting-field full"><label class="setting-field__label"><span>User Prompt</span><small class="setting-field__key">clozeOcrUserPrompt</small></label><textarea class="textarea" id="setting_clozeOcrUserPrompt" rows="5" placeholder="User Prompt"></textarea><p class="setting-help">&#123;&#123;source_type&#125;&#125;、&#123;&#123;year&#125;&#125;、&#123;&#123;source_name&#125;&#125;、&#123;&#123;chapter&#125;&#125;、&#123;&#123;note&#125;&#125;、&#123;&#123;image_count&#125;&#125;を置換します。</p></div></div></section><section class="setting-group"><h4 class="setting-group__title"><svg class="icon "><use href="/prototype-assets/icons/icons.svg#i-sliders"></use></svg>2. 問題別AI解説</h4><div class="setting-field-grid"><div class="setting-field"><label class="setting-field__label"><span>AIモデル</span><small class="setting-field__key">clozeExplanationAiProvider</small></label><select class="select" id="setting_clozeExplanationAiProvider"></select><p class="setting-help">AIモデルページで設定したモデルを選択します。</p></div><div class="setting-field"><label class="setting-field__label"><span>1回の最大生成問題数</span><small class="setting-field__key">clozeExplanationBatchMax</small></label><input class="input" type="number" id="setting_clozeExplanationBatchMax" min="1" max="100"><p class="setting-help">1～100。</p></div><div class="setting-field"><label class="setting-field__label"><span>同時処理スレッド数</span><small class="setting-field__key">clozeExplanationThreads</small></label><input class="input" type="number" id="setting_clozeExplanationThreads" min="1" max="10"><p class="setting-help">1～10。</p></div><div class="setting-field full"><label class="setting-field__label"><span>System Prompt</span><small class="setting-field__key">clozeExplanationSystemPrompt</small></label><textarea class="textarea" id="setting_clozeExplanationSystemPrompt" rows="5" placeholder="System Prompt"></textarea><p class="setting-help">1回につき1問だけを分析し、知識ポイントと日本語解説をJSONで生成します。</p></div><div class="setting-field full"><label class="setting-field__label"><span>User Prompt</span><small class="setting-field__key">clozeExplanationUserPrompt</small></label><textarea class="textarea" id="setting_clozeExplanationUserPrompt" rows="5" placeholder="User Prompt"></textarea><p class="setting-help">&#123;&#123;question_no&#125;&#125;、&#123;&#123;question_text_json&#125;&#125;、&#123;&#123;options_json&#125;&#125;、&#123;&#123;student_answer_json&#125;&#125;、&#123;&#123;correct_answer_json&#125;&#125;を置換します。</p></div></div></section></article><article class="setting-panel" data-panel="english_reading_intensive" hidden><header class="setting-panel__head"><h3><svg class="icon "><use href="/prototype-assets/icons/icons.svg#i-book-open"></use></svg>英語読解・精読</h3><p>長文画像をOCRし、導読・逐文精読・設問解析を生成する4段階処理を設定します。</p></header><div class="setting-process-flow"><span class="setting-flow-step"><svg class="icon "><use href="/prototype-assets/icons/icons.svg#i-check-circle"></use></svg>OCR実行</span><span class="setting-flow-arrow">→</span><span class="setting-flow-step"><svg class="icon "><use href="/prototype-assets/icons/icons.svg#i-check-circle"></use></svg>基本情報・導読</span><span class="setting-flow-arrow">→</span><span class="setting-flow-step"><svg class="icon "><use href="/prototype-assets/icons/icons.svg#i-check-circle"></use></svg>解説・語彙</span><span class="setting-flow-arrow">→</span><span class="setting-flow-step"><svg class="icon "><use href="/prototype-assets/icons/icons.svg#i-check-circle"></use></svg>設問解析</span></div><div class="setting-method-tabs"><button type="button" class="setting-method-tab active" data-tab="方式A">方式A</button><button type="button" class="setting-method-tab" data-tab="方式B">方式B</button></div><section class="setting-tab-panel" data-tab-panel="方式A"><div class="setting-field-grid"><div class="setting-field"><label class="setting-field__label"><span>方式A 文章OCRモデル</span><small class="setting-field__key">intensiveMethodAArticleOcrProvider</small></label><select class="select" id="setting_intensiveMethodAArticleOcrProvider"><option value="bigmodel:1">BigModel / 智谱 OCR（glm-ocr）</option></select></div><div class="setting-field full"><label class="setting-field__label"><span>方式A 設問画像 System Prompt</span><small class="setting-field__key">intensiveOcrQuestionSystemPrompt</small></label><textarea class="textarea" id="setting_intensiveOcrQuestionSystemPrompt" rows="5" placeholder="方式A 設問画像 System Prompt"></textarea></div><div class="setting-field full"><label class="setting-field__label"><span>方式A 設問画像 User Prompt</span><small class="setting-field__key">intensiveOcrQuestionUserPrompt</small></label><textarea class="textarea" id="setting_intensiveOcrQuestionUserPrompt" rows="5" placeholder="方式A 設問画像 User Prompt"></textarea></div><div class="setting-field full"><label class="setting-field__label"><span>方式A 整形 System Prompt</span><small class="setting-field__key">intensiveOcrMethodAStructureSystemPrompt</small></label><textarea class="textarea" id="setting_intensiveOcrMethodAStructureSystemPrompt" rows="5" placeholder="方式A 整形 System Prompt"></textarea></div><div class="setting-field full"><label class="setting-field__label"><span>方式A 整形 User Prompt</span><small class="setting-field__key">intensiveOcrMethodAStructureUserPrompt</small></label><textarea class="textarea" id="setting_intensiveOcrMethodAStructureUserPrompt" rows="5" placeholder="方式A 整形 User Prompt"></textarea></div></div></section><section class="setting-tab-panel" data-tab-panel="方式B" hidden><div class="setting-field-grid"><div class="setting-field"><label class="setting-field__label"><span>方式B OCR用モデル</span><small class="setting-field__key">intensiveMethodBOcrProvider</small></label><select class="select" id="setting_intensiveMethodBOcrProvider"><option value="bigmodel:1">BigModel / 智谱 OCR（glm-ocr）</option></select></div><div class="setting-field full"><label class="setting-field__label"><span>方式B batC15-3 System Prompt</span><small class="setting-field__key">intensiveOcrStructureSystemPrompt</small></label><textarea class="textarea" id="setting_intensiveOcrStructureSystemPrompt" rows="5" placeholder="方式B batC15-3 System Prompt"></textarea></div><div class="setting-field full"><label class="setting-field__label"><span>方式B batC15-3 User Prompt</span><small class="setting-field__key">intensiveOcrStructureUserPrompt</small></label><textarea class="textarea" id="setting_intensiveOcrStructureUserPrompt" rows="5" placeholder="方式B batC15-3 User Prompt"></textarea></div></div></section></article><article class="setting-panel" data-panel="study_monitor" hidden><header class="setting-panel__head"><h3><svg class="icon "><use href="/prototype-assets/icons/icons.svg#i-video"></use></svg>学習状況モニター</h3><p>動画の取込時間帯、スナップショット、およびAI分析条件を設定します。</p></header><section class="setting-group"><h4 class="setting-group__title"><svg class="icon "><use href="/prototype-assets/icons/icons.svg#i-sliders"></use></svg>動画取込</h4><div class="setting-field-grid"><div class="setting-field"><label class="setting-field__label"><span>動画ソースフォルダ</span><small class="setting-field__key">monitorVideoSourceDirectory</small></label><input class="input" type="text" id="setting_monitorVideoSourceDirectory"><p class="setting-help">batL02 が再帰的に動画ファイルを検索するフォルダの絶対パス。</p></div><div class="setting-field"><label class="setting-field__label"><span>スナップショット保存フォルダ</span><small class="setting-field__key">monitorSnapshotOutputDirectory</small></label><input class="input" type="text" id="setting_monitorSnapshotOutputDirectory"><p class="setting-help">batL02 が切り出した画像を保存する絶対パス。</p></div><div class="setting-field"><label class="setting-field__label"><span>動画処理開始時刻</span><small class="setting-field__key">monitorVideoProcessingStartTime</small></label><input class="input" type="time" id="setting_monitorVideoProcessingStartTime"></div><div class="setting-field"><label class="setting-field__label"><span>動画処理終了時刻</span><small class="setting-field__key">monitorVideoProcessingEndTime</small></label><input class="input" type="time" id="setting_monitorVideoProcessingEndTime"></div><div class="setting-field"><label class="setting-field__label"><span>スナップショット間隔（秒）</span><small class="setting-field__key">monitorSnapshotIntervalSeconds</small></label><input class="input" type="number" id="setting_monitorSnapshotIntervalSeconds" min="1" max="3600"><p class="setting-help">1～3600。</p></div></div></section><section class="setting-group"><h4 class="setting-group__title"><svg class="icon "><use href="/prototype-assets/icons/icons.svg#i-sliders"></use></svg>AI分析（batL03）</h4><div class="setting-field-grid"><div class="setting-field"><label class="setting-field__label"><span>1回のAI分析枚数</span><small class="setting-field__key">monitorAiBatchLimit</small></label><input class="input" type="number" id="setting_monitorAiBatchLimit" min="1" max="100"><p class="setting-help">1～100。</p></div><div class="setting-field"><label class="setting-field__label"><span>AI分析処理スレッド数</span><small class="setting-field__key">monitorAiThreads</small></label><input class="input" type="number" id="setting_monitorAiThreads" min="1" max="10"><p class="setting-help">1～10。</p></div><div class="setting-field"><label class="setting-field__label"><span>AI応答タイムアウト（秒）</span><small class="setting-field__key">monitorAiTimeoutSeconds</small></label><input class="input" type="number" id="setting_monitorAiTimeoutSeconds" min="30" max="600"><p class="setting-help">30～600。</p></div><div class="setting-field"><label class="setting-field__label"><span>AI送信画像解像度</span><small class="setting-field__key">monitorAiImageResolution</small></label><select class="select" id="setting_monitorAiImageResolution"><option value="3840×2160">3840×2160</option><option value="2560×1440">2560×1440</option><option value="1920×1080">1920×1080</option><option value="1280×720">1280×720</option></select></div></div></section><section class="setting-group"><h4 class="setting-group__title"><svg class="icon "><use href="/prototype-assets/icons/icons.svg#i-sliders"></use></svg>カメラ基本情報</h4><div class="setting-field-grid"><div class="setting-field"><label class="setting-field__label"><span>設置場所</span><small class="setting-field__key">monitorCameraLocation</small></label><input class="input" type="text" id="setting_monitorCameraLocation"><p class="setting-help">例：自習室の学習机正面。</p></div><div class="setting-field full"><label class="setting-field__label"><span>撮影範囲・補足</span><small class="setting-field__key">monitorCameraContext</small></label><textarea class="textarea" id="setting_monitorCameraContext" rows="5" placeholder="撮影範囲・補足"></textarea><p class="setting-help">例：机、椅子、PC画面、ノートが映る。</p></div></div></section><section class="setting-group"><h4 class="setting-group__title"><svg class="icon "><use href="/prototype-assets/icons/icons.svg#i-sliders"></use></svg>1. 一次判定（高速）</h4><div class="setting-field-grid"><div class="setting-field"><label class="setting-field__label"><span>AIモデル</span><small class="setting-field__key">monitorFirstAiProvider</small></label><select class="select" id="setting_monitorFirstAiProvider"></select><p class="setting-help">通常は Qwen3-VL-Flash を選択。</p></div><div class="setting-field"><label class="setting-field__label"><span>二次判定しきい値</span><small class="setting-field__key">monitorConfidenceThreshold</small></label><select class="select" id="setting_monitorConfidenceThreshold"><option value="0.70">0.70</option><option value="0.75">0.75</option><option value="0.80">0.80</option><option value="0.85">0.85</option><option value="0.90">0.90</option></select></div><div class="setting-field full"><label class="setting-field__label"><span>System Prompt</span><small class="setting-field__key">monitorFirstSystemPrompt</small></label><textarea class="textarea" id="setting_monitorFirstSystemPrompt" rows="5" placeholder="System Prompt"></textarea><p class="setting-help">画面内容を優先して、6種類の状態と confidence / reason をJSONで返します。</p></div><div class="setting-field full"><label class="setting-field__label"><span>User Prompt</span><small class="setting-field__key">monitorFirstUserPrompt</small></label><textarea class="textarea" id="setting_monitorFirstUserPrompt" rows="5" placeholder="User Prompt"></textarea><p class="setting-help">画像左上の撮影日時を確認するよう指示し、画像だけを渡します。</p></div></div></section><section class="setting-group"><h4 class="setting-group__title"><svg class="icon "><use href="/prototype-assets/icons/icons.svg#i-sliders"></use></svg>2. 二次判定（精密）</h4><div class="setting-field-grid"><div class="setting-field"><label class="setting-field__label"><span>AIモデル</span><small class="setting-field__key">monitorSecondAiProvider</small></label><select class="select" id="setting_monitorSecondAiProvider"></select><p class="setting-help">通常は Qwen3-VL-Plus を選択。</p></div><div class="setting-field full"><label class="setting-field__label"><span>System Prompt</span><small class="setting-field__key">monitorSecondSystemPrompt</small></label><textarea class="textarea" id="setting_monitorSecondSystemPrompt" rows="5" placeholder="System Prompt"></textarea><p class="setting-help">画面内容・姿勢・机上の物品を深度分析し、最終状態と detailed_reasoning をJSONで返します。</p></div><div class="setting-field full"><label class="setting-field__label"><span>User Prompt</span><small class="setting-field__key">monitorSecondUserPrompt</small></label><textarea class="textarea" id="setting_monitorSecondUserPrompt" rows="5" placeholder="User Prompt"></textarea><p class="setting-help">一次判定情報やカメラ情報を渡さず、同一画像だけを独立して判定させます。</p></div></div></section></article><article class="setting-panel" data-panel="daily_report" hidden><header class="setting-panel__head"><h3><svg class="icon "><use href="/prototype-assets/icons/icons.svg#i-book"></use></svg>学習日報</h3><p>当日の学習日報が未記入の場合にホーム画面で通知するかを設定します。</p></header><section class="setting-group"><h4 class="setting-group__title"><svg class="icon "><use href="/prototype-assets/icons/icons.svg#i-sliders"></use></svg>ホーム画面通知</h4><div class="setting-field-grid"><div class="setting-field"><label class="setting-field__label"><span>未記入リマインダー</span><small class="setting-field__key">dailyReportReminderEnabled</small></label><select class="select" id="setting_dailyReportReminderEnabled"><option value="true">有効</option><option value="false">無効</option></select><p class="setting-help">有効の場合、当日の学習日報がまだ保存されていないとホーム画面に案内を表示します。</p></div></div></section></article><article class="setting-panel" data-panel="english_word_textbook_ai" hidden><header class="setting-panel__head"><h3><svg class="icon "><use href="/prototype-assets/icons/icons.svg#i-book-open"></use></svg>英単語教材AI認識</h3><p>Qwen-VL-OCR Batch による英単語教材画像のAI認識設定を行います。</p></header><span class="setting-io-badge" style="margin-bottom:12px"><svg class="icon "><use href="/prototype-assets/icons/icons.svg#i-image"></use></svg>画像 → テキスト（JSON）</span><div class="setting-method-tabs"><button type="button" class="setting-method-tab active" data-tab="基本設定">基本設定</button><button type="button" class="setting-method-tab" data-tab="System Prompt">System Prompt</button><button type="button" class="setting-method-tab" data-tab="User Prompt">User Prompt</button><button type="button" class="setting-method-tab" data-tab="その他">その他</button></div><section class="setting-tab-panel" data-tab-panel="基本設定"><div class="setting-field-grid"><div class="setting-field"><label class="setting-field__label"><span>使用AIモデル</span><small class="setting-field__key">wtbAiProvider</small></label><select class="select" id="setting_wtbAiProvider"></select></div><div class="setting-field"><label class="setting-field__label"><span>完了待ち時間</span><small class="setting-field__key">wtbAiCompleti